{{High Risk|Template:Privated media|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Adds a compact "Privated" badge to song list entries, marking a video that still exists but has been set to private. Optionally shows the platform icon for the site involved. See {{T|Deleted media}} for videos that have been removed entirely.

==Syntax==
{{T|Privated media|v1=site =}}

==Examples==
* {{T|Privated media|_Y_=1}}
* {{T|Privated media|_Y_=1|p1=site = yt}}
* {{T|Privated media|_Y_=1|p1=site = nnd}}

Used in a full song list line:
<pre>* "Song Name" {{yt|ABC123}} {{nnd|DEF456}} (description) (2024.01.25) {{Privated media|site=nnd}}</pre>
* "Song Name" {{yt|ABC123}} {{nnd|DEF456}} (description) (2024.01.25) {{Privated media|site=nnd}}

